# public/tmp-mockup-images/ is scratch art in general, but the sample
# set below is committed so a fresh clone renders kit fixtures and the
# v2 mockup pages with no image 404s. Any new scratch art dropped into
# these two folders stays ignored unless added to this list; do not
# widen these !patterns without also committing the file, and keep
# each committed original under the size ruled at commit time
# (resized to a card/tile display dimension, compressed, never a raw
# original).
